    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Investigating this in a bit more detail",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "SimpleDOWriter.addRelationship writes the new triple to a ByteArrayOutputStream in the format org.trippi.RDFFormat.RDF_XML - this format specifies UTF-8 (and not the platform default encoding).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Subsequently when converting this stream to a string (xmlContent) no encoding is specified, so it is incorrectly interpreted using the platform default encoding.  The string is then converted back to bytes and assigned to the datastream, which by default uses UTF-8.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "There appears to be no need for this intermediate string xmlContent, instead out.toByteArray() can be used directly, as this will be UTF-8.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As RDFormat.RDF_XML is UTF-8 and by default DatastreamXMLMetadata is UTF-8 by default this should be fine.  A better solution could be to construct the DatastreamXMLMetadata and explicitly specify the encoding as RDFFormat.RDF_XML.getEncoding().",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
