      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This is in branch \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-549\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-549\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"RELS-EXT is not validated on creation, only validated when updated\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-549\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>Note that integration tests only pick up an issue if the server platform encoding is not utf-8, eg use java opt -Dfile.encoding=cp1252</p>\n\n<p>Also bug \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-569\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-569\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"fedora/risearch GET query returns incorrect result when querying on literal object that contains multibyte utf-8 sequences\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-569\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n discovered whilst implementing integration tests for this; work-around implemented pending resolution of this.</p>",
